/public/hot

# The compiled Vite output used to be committed here because the production
# server had no confirmed Node.js. It does now, so the build happens there
# instead — Plesk's "Additional deployment actions" must run
# `npm ci && npm run build` on every deploy. Without that step the server
# ends up with no build/manifest.json at all and every page 500s, so the
# deploy action has to exist BEFORE this ignore rule reaches production.
/public/build
/public/storage
/storage/*.key
/storage/pail
/vendor

# dompdf's font cache (config/dompdf.php font_dir/font_cache). Regenerated
# automatically the first time a PDF is exported. Also, on this project it
# currently caches a copy of Tahoma (see app/Console/Commands/RegisterPdfThaiFont.php)
# which is a Windows-bundled font and not freely redistributable — must
# never be committed regardless of the "just a cache" reason above.
/storage/fonts
Homestead.json
Homestead.yaml
Thumbs.db
